### Goal Model

Below is the goal model constructed based on the mission description provided. The goal model is represented using tables for goals and tasks, along with their relationships and justifications.

---

### Goals Table

| **Name** | **Text** | **Runtime** | **Goal Type** | **Target Condition** | **Relation** | **Justification** |
|----------|----------|-------------|---------------|----------------------|--------------|--------------------|
| **G1** | Fulfill the Resource Request | "-" | Achieve | The requested resources are collected and delivered to the specified location. | - | The root goal is to achieve the overall mission of fulfilling the resource request. |
| **G2** | Collect Required Resources | ";" | Achieve | All requested resources have been collected from their respective storage locations. | AND | The collection phase must be completed before delivery can begin. |
| **G3** | Navigate to Storage Locations | "-" | Perform | The robot has navigated to the storage locations where the requested resources are located. | AND | The robot must navigate to the storage locations to collect resources. |
| **G4** | Request Resources from Storage | "-" | Perform | The robot has successfully requested and retrieved the requested resources from the storage. | AND | The robot must request resources from storage after navigating to the correct location. |
| **G5** | Check Resource Availability | "-" | Query | The availability status of the requested resources. | AND | The robot must check if the requested resources are available before proceeding. |
| **G6** | Deliver Resources to Requesting Agent | "-" | Achieve | The requested resources have been delivered to the specified location. | AND | Delivery can only begin after all resources have been collected. |
| **G7** | Navigate to Delivery Location | "-" | Perform | The robot has navigated to the specified delivery location. | AND | The robot must navigate to the delivery location to deliver the resources. |
| **G8** | Deposit Resources | "-" | Perform | The requested resources have been deposited at the specified location. | AND | The robot must deposit the resources after navigating to the delivery location. |
| **G9** | Assign Mission to Another Robot (Collection Phase) | "-" | Perform | The mission has been assigned to another robot. | OR | If the battery level drops to 10%, the robot must recharge and assign the mission to another robot. |
| **G10** | Return Resources to Checkpoint (Delivery Phase) | "-" | Perform | The resources have been returned to a checkpoint. | OR | If the battery level drops to 30% during delivery, the robot must return the resources to a checkpoint and assign the remaining task to another robot. |
| **G11** | Trigger Alert for Resource Loss | "-" | Perform | An alert has been triggered for the loss of resources. | OR | If the robot fails to return the resources to a checkpoint, an alert must be triggered and a report sent to the sector manager. |
| **G12** | Parallel Execution of Collect-Deliver Tasks | "#" | Perform | Multiple robots are executing collect-deliver tasks in parallel. | AND | Multiple robots can be assigned to parallel collect-deliver tasks to reduce the time to finish the mission. |

